{
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "slug": "list",
  "title": "List",
  "group": "Data display",
  "order": 1,
  "summary": {
    "en": "The inset grouped list: rows on one surface, separated by hairlines that start where the text starts. The default for any list of things, instead of a stack of cards.",
    "id": "Daftar berkelompok yang menjorok: baris di satu permukaan, dipisah garis tipis yang dimulai di awal teks. Default untuk daftar apa pun, sebagai ganti tumpukan kartu."
  },
  "titleId": "List",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Navigation rows",
        "desc": "Icons in colored squares, a value or a count, and a chevron. The hairline starts at the text.",
        "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 440px;\">\n  <p class=\"list__header\">Account</p>\n  <div class=\"list\">\n    <a class=\"lrow lrow--icon\" href=\"#profile\"><span class=\"lrow__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">person</span></span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Profile</span></span><span class=\"ic lrow__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">chevron_right</span></a>\n    <a class=\"lrow lrow--icon\" href=\"#notifications\"><span class=\"lrow__icon\" style=\"background: var(--tile-red);\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">notifications</span></span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Notifications</span></span><span class=\"count\">3<span class=\"sr-only\"> new</span></span><span class=\"ic lrow__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">chevron_right</span></a>\n    <a class=\"lrow lrow--icon\" href=\"#language\"><span class=\"lrow__icon\" style=\"background: var(--tile-green);\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">public</span></span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Language</span></span><span class=\"lrow__value\">English</span><span class=\"ic lrow__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">chevron_right</span></a>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"list__footer\">Changes apply on every device you sign in to.</p>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Two-line rows with values",
        "desc": "A title and a second line on the left, the value on the right.",
        "html": "<ul class=\"list\" style=\"max-width: 440px;\">\n  <li class=\"lrow\"><div class=\"lrow__body\"><div class=\"lrow__title\">Land and building tax 2026</div><div class=\"lrow__sub\">Paid 2 Sep by bank transfer</div></div><span class=\"lrow__value\">Rp 1.250.000</span></li>\n  <li class=\"lrow\"><div class=\"lrow__body\"><div class=\"lrow__title\">Waste collection levy</div><div class=\"lrow__sub\">Paid 2 Sep</div></div><span class=\"lrow__value\">Rp 35.000</span></li>\n  <li class=\"lrow\"><div class=\"lrow__body\"><div class=\"lrow__title\">Motor vehicle tax</div><div class=\"lrow__sub\">Due 28 Nov</div></div><span class=\"badge badge--warning\">Not paid</span></li>\n</ul>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Numbered steps",
        "desc": "An order to follow. Use `<ol>` so the order is in the markup too.",
        "html": "<ol class=\"list list--fill\" style=\"max-width: 440px;\">\n  <li class=\"lrow lrow--num\"><span class=\"lrow__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Download the registration form and fill in every page.</span></span></li>\n  <li class=\"lrow lrow--num\"><span class=\"lrow__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Ask the lurah to sign page 3.</span></span></li>\n  <li class=\"lrow lrow--num\"><span class=\"lrow__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Upload the signed form before 28 November.</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">PDF, up to 5 MB</span></span></li>\n</ol>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Checked rows",
        "desc": "Requirements met, or what a service includes.",
        "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 440px;\">\n  <p class=\"list__header\">Included in MSME assistance</p>\n  <ul class=\"list\">\n    <li class=\"lrow lrow--check\"><span class=\"ic lrow__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Help registering a business ID number (NIB)</span></span></li>\n    <li class=\"lrow lrow--check\"><span class=\"ic lrow__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Simple bookkeeping training</span></span></li>\n    <li class=\"lrow lrow--check\"><span class=\"ic lrow__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">A monthly consultation with an assistant officer</span></span></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Settings with switches",
        "desc": "A switch with its label fills the row; the label is the switch text.",
        "html": "<div class=\"list\" style=\"max-width: 440px;\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><label class=\"switch\" style=\"flex: 1;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\" checked><span class=\"switch__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"switch__thumb\"></span></span><span class=\"switch__text\">Email me when my application status changes</span></label></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><label class=\"switch\" style=\"flex: 1;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\"><span class=\"switch__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"switch__thumb\"></span></span><span class=\"switch__text\">Weekly summary of citizen reports</span></label></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Baris navigasi",
        "desc": "Ikon di kotak berwarna, nilai atau hitungan, dan chevron. Garis tipis dimulai di teks.",
        "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 440px;\">\n  <p class=\"list__header\">Akun</p>\n  <div class=\"list\">\n    <a class=\"lrow lrow--icon\" href=\"#profile\"><span class=\"lrow__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">person</span></span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Profil</span></span><span class=\"ic lrow__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">chevron_right</span></a>\n    <a class=\"lrow lrow--icon\" href=\"#notifications\"><span class=\"lrow__icon\" style=\"background: var(--tile-red);\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">notifications</span></span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Notifikasi</span></span><span class=\"count\">3<span class=\"sr-only\"> baru</span></span><span class=\"ic lrow__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">chevron_right</span></a>\n    <a class=\"lrow lrow--icon\" href=\"#language\"><span class=\"lrow__icon\" style=\"background: var(--tile-green);\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">public</span></span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Bahasa</span></span><span class=\"lrow__value\">Indonesia</span><span class=\"ic lrow__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">chevron_right</span></a>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"list__footer\">Perubahan berlaku di setiap perangkat tempat Anda masuk.</p>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Baris dua lapis dengan nilai",
        "desc": "Judul dan baris kedua di kiri, nilainya di kanan.",
        "html": "<ul class=\"list\" style=\"max-width: 440px;\">\n  <li class=\"lrow\"><div class=\"lrow__body\"><div class=\"lrow__title\">Pajak bumi dan bangunan 2026</div><div class=\"lrow__sub\">Dibayar 2 Sep lewat transfer bank</div></div><span class=\"lrow__value\">Rp 1.250.000</span></li>\n  <li class=\"lrow\"><div class=\"lrow__body\"><div class=\"lrow__title\">Retribusi sampah</div><div class=\"lrow__sub\">Dibayar 2 Sep</div></div><span class=\"lrow__value\">Rp 35.000</span></li>\n  <li class=\"lrow\"><div class=\"lrow__body\"><div class=\"lrow__title\">Pajak kendaraan bermotor</div><div class=\"lrow__sub\">Jatuh tempo 28 Nov</div></div><span class=\"badge badge--warning\">Belum dibayar</span></li>\n</ul>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Langkah bernomor",
        "desc": "Urutan yang diikuti. Pakai `<ol>` agar urutannya juga ada di markup.",
        "html": "<ol class=\"list list--fill\" style=\"max-width: 440px;\">\n  <li class=\"lrow lrow--num\"><span class=\"lrow__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Unduh formulir pendaftaran dan isi setiap halamannya.</span></span></li>\n  <li class=\"lrow lrow--num\"><span class=\"lrow__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Minta tanda tangan lurah di halaman 3.</span></span></li>\n  <li class=\"lrow lrow--num\"><span class=\"lrow__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Unggah formulir yang sudah ditandatangani sebelum 28 November.</span><span class=\"lrow__sub\">PDF, maksimal 5 MB</span></span></li>\n</ol>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Baris tercentang",
        "desc": "Persyaratan yang terpenuhi, atau isi sebuah layanan.",
        "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 440px;\">\n  <p class=\"list__header\">Termasuk dalam pendampingan UMKM</p>\n  <ul class=\"list\">\n    <li class=\"lrow lrow--check\"><span class=\"ic lrow__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Bantuan mengurus nomor induk berusaha</span></span></li>\n    <li class=\"lrow lrow--check\"><span class=\"ic lrow__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Pelatihan pembukuan sederhana</span></span></li>\n    <li class=\"lrow lrow--check\"><span class=\"ic lrow__check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">check_circle</span><span class=\"lrow__body\"><span class=\"lrow__title\">Jadwal konsultasi bulanan dengan pendamping</span></span></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pengaturan dengan switch",
        "desc": "Switch dengan labelnya memenuhi baris; labelnya adalah teks switch.",
        "html": "<div class=\"list\" style=\"max-width: 440px;\">\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><label class=\"switch\" style=\"flex: 1;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\" checked><span class=\"switch__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"switch__thumb\"></span></span><span class=\"switch__text\">Kirim email saat status permohonan berubah</span></label></div>\n  <div class=\"lrow\"><label class=\"switch\" style=\"flex: 1;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\"><span class=\"switch__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"switch__thumb\"></span></span><span class=\"switch__text\">Ringkasan mingguan laporan warga</span></label></div>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
